      "role": "user",
      "content": "现在是什么情况？我觉得你怎么确保 Redis 的一致性？",
      "type": "text",
      "created_at": 1769838317,
      "children_ids": [
        "msg_80dc1d9bdf92"
      ],
      "model_info": null,
      "usage": null,
